WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.979
Here's a quick tour of the Formula Forum app for attendees.

2
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.836
Everything starts on Today.

3
00:00:06.886 --> 00:00:13.952
You'll see your first move, a shortcut into your Formula work, and a short checklist to get ready before doors open.

4
00:00:14.002 --> 00:00:16.651
Scroll down to see what the forum is saying.

5
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.678
Agenda shows the full schedule, day by day.

6
00:00:20.728 --> 00:00:22.716
Tap the star to save a session.

7
00:00:22.766 --> 00:00:26.859
Then switch to My Schedule to see just the sessions you picked.

8
00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.281
Networking makes the room smaller.

9
00:00:30.331 --> 00:00:35.769
Scan someone to create a connection, or show your own QR code so they can find you.

10
00:00:35.819 --> 00:00:39.624
Before you scan, the app explains exactly what gets shared.

11
00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:44.666
Build 2027 is where the workshop becomes a plan.

12
00:00:44.716 --> 00:00:50.526
Every session in your workbook has its own pages, starting with session one, The Sales Sequence.

13
00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:56.467
When a session ends, open it in the app, and photograph your three completed pages.

14
00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:02.617
Your scores, your notes, your answers, and the one Domino you'd change first.

15
00:01:02.667 --> 00:01:07.051
Mark your seat, owner, team, or partner, and capture all three pages.

16
00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:11.826
Formula AI reads all three pages in one pass.

17
00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.694
Then you confirm what it read.

18
00:01:16.744 --> 00:01:22.485
Your Agency Domino, your three scores, and every answer from the page, word for word.

19
00:01:22.535 --> 00:01:26.028
Fix anything it got wrong before your plan is built.

20
00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:31.555
Your ninety-day install plan is built from your own answers.

21
00:01:31.605 --> 00:01:32.852
A scores snapshot.

22
00:01:32.902 --> 00:01:35.231
A thirty, sixty, ninety day plan.

23
00:01:35.281 --> 00:01:41.502
A daily producer scorecard, a weekly sales-management agenda, and a recruiting profile.

24
00:01:41.552 --> 00:01:44.745
Where you left a decision open, it tells you.

25
00:01:44.795 --> 00:01:47.196
And it ends the way the room does.

26
00:01:47.246 --> 00:01:47.989
Now run it.

27
00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:51.569
Flows are short, guided reflections.

28
00:01:51.619 --> 00:01:56.657
The Formula Flow takes 5 to 8 minutes and asks one question at a time.

29
00:01:56.707 --> 00:01:59.035
Bible and Prayer flows are here too.

30
00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:03.955
Messages keeps your conversations with new connections in one place.

31
00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:09.107
And notifications keep you up to date on the forum and your network.

32
00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:11.890
That's Formula Forum.

33
00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:16.472
Save your sessions, make your connections, and build what's next.

34
00:02:16.522 --> 00:02:20.348
This demonstration was recorded with local sample data.
